// #849: a Future created and awaited in a `map` body: `(0..2).map() -> index { await Now().named("x" + index.string()); }`.
// The body scope S3 owns the duty. The builder's unwind cleanup made before the Future is not reused after it, so
// the failure of `Now()` and the failure of the await close S3 on separate paths, each with or without the duty
// on all of them; the builder lives across the await in the frame. Own's output of the program (OIR-2 pipeline).
